{"unit_id":"PKUfudawei__dsh-capability-menu#card-zh","repo":"PKUfudawei/dsh-capability-menu","commit":"d762db8356105d0a79490a3b8135d83a460ec039","type":"card","lang":"zh","text":"Capability Menu 是面向 DSH Web 的工具与技能管理插件。它建立统一能力目录，并通过 Resident、On-demand、Disabled 规则控制内容是否常驻、按需发现或禁用。模型使用 meta_search 搜索按需能力并检查工具参数，再通过 meta_invoke 调用工具或加载技能说明。设置页可浏览并分类能力、编辑检索摘要、登记 MCP 服务和技能目录，并检查或更新 GitHub 导入的技能。适合希望减少常驻上下文、集中管理工具与技能的 DSH 用户。无需专属 API Key；导入 GitHub 技能需在 DSH 机器安装 Git。","source":"generated","evidence":["cordis.patch.yml:15-61","src/search.ts:64-73","src/invoke.ts:91-105","src/client/index.ts:457-468","src/locations.ts:358-420"]}
{"unit_id":"PKUfudawei__dsh-capability-menu#card-en","repo":"PKUfudawei/dsh-capability-menu","commit":"d762db8356105d0a79490a3b8135d83a460ec039","type":"card","lang":"en","text":"Capability Menu manages DSH Web tools and skills with Resident, On-demand, and Disabled rules. meta_search finds on-demand capabilities; meta_invoke calls tools or loads skills. Its settings panel manages tiers, MCP servers, skill sources, and GitHub updates. Git is needed for GitHub imports.","source":"generated","evidence":["cordis.patch.yml:15-61","src/search.ts:64-73","src/invoke.ts:91-105","src/client/index.ts:457-468","src/locations.ts:358-420"]}
